<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-18T22:14:09.140Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
